---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LegalLanguageNotice from '../../components/LegalLanguageNotice';
import { sitePath, SITE_HOST, GTM_ID, GOOGLE_ADS_ID } from '../../lib/site';

const title = "Cookie Policy | CourtSide Padel Retreats";
const description = `Information about how CourtSide Padel Retreats uses cookies on ${SITE_HOST}.`;
const canonical = sitePath('/legal/cookie-policy');
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} hideLangToggle={true}>
  <main id="main-content" class="bg-white min-h-screen pt-32 pb-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-8">
      <LegalLanguageNotice client:load />

      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-gold font-semibold mb-4">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-brand-dark tracking-wide mb-4">Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-brand-dark/50 text-sm mb-12">Last updated: June 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-brand-dark/80 space-y-10">

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">1. What are cookies?</h2>
          <p>Cookies are small text files placed on your device by a website you visit. They are widely used to make websites work efficiently and to provide information to the site owner.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">2. Cookies we use</h2>
          <p>We use <strong>essential cookies</strong> that are strictly necessary for the website to function, and <strong>analytics and advertising cookies</strong> (via Google Tag Manager) that are only set if you accept non-essential cookies in our consent banner.</p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mt-6 mb-3">2.1 Essential cookies</h3>
          <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse mt-2">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-brand-dark/20">
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark">Name</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark">Purpose</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 font-semibold text-brand-dark">Duration</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-brand-dark/10">
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-xs">i18next</td>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4">Remembers your language preference (English / Spanish / French)</td>
                <td class="py-2">Persistent (localStorage)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-xs">cs_cookie_consent</td>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4">Stores your cookie consent choice (accept or reject non-essential cookies)</td>
                <td class="py-2">Persistent (localStorage)</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-brand-dark/60">Essential cookies do not require consent under UK PECR / EU ePrivacy Directive as they are strictly necessary for the operation of the website.</p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mt-6 mb-3">2.2 Analytics cookies (consent required)</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-dark/70">These cookies are loaded through <strong>Google Tag Manager</strong> ({GTM_ID}) only after you click <strong>Accept all</strong> in our cookie banner. If you click <strong>Reject non-essential</strong>, they are not set.</p>
          <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse mt-4">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-brand-dark/20">
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark">Name</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark">Provider</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark">Purpose</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 font-semibold text-brand-dark">Duration</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-brand-dark/10">
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-xs">_ga</td>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4">Google Analytics</td>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4">Distinguishes unique users for website usage statistics</td>
                <td class="py-2">2 years</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-xs">_ga_*</td>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4">Google Analytics</td>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4">Maintains session state for analytics measurement</td>
                <td class="py-2">2 years</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-brand-dark/60">We use <a href="https://developers.google.com/tag-platform/security/guides/consent" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Consent Mode v2</a> to ensure analytics and advertising storage remain denied until you grant consent.</p>

          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-dark mt-6 mb-3">2.3 Advertising cookies (consent required)</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-dark/70">These cookies are used to measure the effectiveness of our advertising campaigns and may be used for remarketing. They are loaded through <strong>Google Tag Manager</strong> ({GTM_ID}) with tag ID <strong>{GOOGLE_ADS_ID}</strong>, only after you click <strong>Accept all</strong>.</p>
          <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse mt-4">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-brand-dark/20">
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark">Name</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark">Provider</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-brand-dark">Purpose</th>
                <th class="text-left py-2 font-semibold text-brand-dark">Duration</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-brand-dark/10">
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-xs">_gcl_au</td>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4">Google Ads</td>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4">Stores ad click information for conversion measurement</td>
                <td class="py-2">3 months</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-xs">_gcl_aw</td>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4">Google Ads</td>
                <td class="py-2 pr-4">Links ad clicks to on-site actions and conversions</td>
                <td class="py-2">3 months</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">3. Third-party cookies</h2>
          <p>Analytics and advertising cookies are set by <strong>Google</strong> via Google Tag Manager. Google's use of data is governed by the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>. You can opt out of Google Analytics across all websites at <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout</a>.</p>
          <p class="mt-3 p-4 border border-brand-gold/40 bg-brand-gold/5 text-sm text-brand-dark/70 rounded">
            <strong>Note:</strong> When our booking enquiry form is replaced with a JotForm embed, JotForm may set its own cookies. This policy will be updated at that time.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">4. How to control cookies</h2>
          <p>You can control and delete cookies through your browser settings. Note that disabling certain cookies may affect the functionality of this website. For guidance, visit:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-3">
            <li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Chrome</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/cookies-information-websites-store-on-your-computer" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mozilla Firefox</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/en-gb/guide/safari/sfri11471/mac" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple Safari</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/edge/manage-cookies-in-microsoft-edge-view-allow-block-delete-and-use" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Microsoft Edge</a></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">You can also opt out of interest-based advertising at <a href="https://youronlinechoices.eu/" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">youronlinechoices.eu</a> (EU) or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a> (US).</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">5. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>We will update this Cookie Policy when we make changes to the cookies we use, including when third-party embeds are added. Check the "Last updated" date above for the most recent version.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-brand-dark mb-4">6. Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about cookies? Contact us at:<br />
          <a href="mailto:awatelet@cspadel.com" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2">awatelet@cspadel.com</a></p>
          <p class="mt-3">For full details on how we use your personal data, see our <a href="/legal/privacy-policy" class="text-brand-gold underline underline-offset-2">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
